(iv) scalar phi^2 dilation seam: chain of S scales, hops phi^2 (outward) / phi^-2 (inward)
   S=6: max|eig(M)-2cos(k pi/(S+1))| = 5.6e-15;  max|M - Dg P Dg^-1| = 4.4e-16  (flat: the scalar dilation is a gauge on this tree; each in-shell square has hop product phi^2*phi^-2 = 1)

